# POLYEDIT-OPS: on a 100 cm Box (base pivot, 0..100 in Y) - Insert Edge Loop, Extrude, Inset, Bevel, each one undo step; four Undo give the original Box
# Edge picks aim the viewport centre at a box edge (P15B); face picks look almost straight down at the top.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Width 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Depth 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Height 100
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 220,260,320
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.5,-0.45,-0.74
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Modeling "Select Elements tool"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection level: PolyEdit"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: Edge"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 250,300,1
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.707,-0.707,0
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Insert Edge Loop"
Тогда-вид 1_loop a new edge loop rings the box across the selected top edge (+X side), splitting top and side faces
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: PolyGroup"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -60,400,-60
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.97,0.15
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject modeling set Element.Distance 30
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Extrude"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject modeling set Element.Distance 10
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Inset"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: Edge"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 250,330,-25
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.707,-0.707,0
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject modeling set Element.Distance 8
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Bevel"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 230,260,300
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.5,-0.45,-0.74
Тогда-вид 2_ops the -Z half of the top extruded 30 cm up, an inset ring on its top, the extrusion's +X top edge bevelled into a chamfer strip
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда-вид 3_undo4 the plain 100 cm box again as before: no loop, no extrusion, no inset, no bevel
